<title>USA: Central &amp; South West sets officer exchange.</title>
<headline>Central &amp; South West sets officer exchange.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central and South West Corp said Friday its Central and South West Services Inc subsidiary has entered into a two-year exchange partnership with the Philippine electric distribution utility Manila Electric Co.</p>
<p>The agreement provides for four to six executive exchange visits a year to discuss key utility topics, Central and South West said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
